   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Formulas and polite forms",
     "texto": [
      "On the phone, **Можно Анну?** is a brief, natural request to speak to Anna; **Анну** is the accusative of **Анна**. **Оставьте** is a formal request to one person or to several: «leave/they leave a message».",
      "In **Её сейчас нет**, **нет** expresses absence and **её** is in the genitive (its form matches the accusative). In **я передам ей, что вы звонили**, **ей** means «to her» and **вы звонили** can be addressed formally to one person; the past uses the plural form."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
